      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Let a woman learn quietly, in complete submission."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/1tim#1Tim.2.15",
      "source_sha256": "e5913c571414b817",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "But she will be saved through bearing children, if they continue in faith, love, and holiness, with self-control."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/1tim#1Tim.3.3",
      "source_sha256": "477bcb0d40cad59a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "He must not be a drunkard or violent, but gentle, not quarrelsome or a lover of money."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/1tim#1Tim.3.4",
      "source_sha256": "631719cd68ef3b69",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "He must manage his own household well, keeping his children in submission and in complete dignity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/1tim#1Tim.4.2",
      "source_sha256": "a2de08e3ea5139c0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Through the hypocrisy of liars whose consciences are seared."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/1tim#1Tim.4.7",
      "source_sha256": "29e9da333044f5cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Reject foolish old women's tales, and train yourself in godliness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-nt/1tim#1Tim.5.14",
      "source_sha256": "fac3d9f2e622e531",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "So I want young women to marry, bear children, and manage their households, giving the opponent no opportunity to speak evil of us."
    }
